  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Jade green water flow moves like a large dragon on the sea surface and tries to escape until it is trapped in a sea area. It is a rank seven immortal material whose famous trait is that it always keeps moving without ever stopping.",
      "chapters": [
        2229
      ],
