      "section": "ever-moving-water",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan takes in the Righteous Qi Alliance, he extorts Eastern Sea’s righteous path for a batch of water path resource points, and jade green water flow is one of them. He Chun Qiu seats the resource point in Mini Eastern Sea with an immortal formation so it cannot flee; from then on the point produces jade green water flow and serves as a water vein node, with room to grow into a jade green water flow sea area.",
